• Experience across B2B and B2C products, or within a B2B2C or other multi-sided product environment &nbsp;

• Experience working directly with customers or users to validate needs, test solutions, and incorporate feedback into product decisions &nbsp;

• Experience partnering closely with Engineering and Design to shape solutions, navigate constraints, and make informed trade-offs &nbsp;

• Demonstrated use of AI to improve aspects of the product development lifecycle &nbsp;

• Clear and confident communication with internal and external stakeholders &nbsp;

• Ability to work effectively across geographically distributed teams &nbsp;

